===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno|en}} {{term|defendour|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|defendeor|lang=fro}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dɪˈfɛndə(ɹ)/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛndə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|defender (football)}}
{{en-noun}}

# Someone who [[defend]]s [[people]] or [[property]].
# {{context|legal|lang=en}} A [[lawyer]] who [[represent]]s [[defendant]]s.
# A [[fighter]] who [[repel]]s an [[attack]].
# {{context|sports|lang=en}} One of the [[players]] whose primary task is to [[prevent]] the opposition from [[scoring]].

